 BSE| Energy of first occupied index [eV]                               -567.995
 BSE| Energy of last empty index [eV]                                    146.605
 BSE| Energy difference of first occupied index to HOMO [eV]             560.360
 BSE| Energy difference of last empty index to LUMO [eV]                 144.509
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected occupied MOs                                     41
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected empty MOs                                       157
 BSE|
 BSE| No truncation of BSE matrices applied
 BSE|
